{"id":"H1760","lemma":"דָּחָה","transliteration":"dachah","sayIt":"da-CHAH","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"verb","gloss":"to thrust","meaning":"1) to push, thrust, chase, overflow, totter, sore, drive away or out, be outcast, be cast down\n1a) (Qal) to push, push violently\n1b) (Niphal) to be thrust, be cast down\n1c) (Pual) to be thrust down","glosses":["thrown down","drives them away","tottering","pushed so hard","make me stumble","driven away into"],"count":7,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"psa-35","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"drives them away"}},{"chapterId":"psa-36","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"thrown down","kjv":"they are cast down"}},{"chapterId":"psa-62","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"or a tottering","kjv":"and as a tottering"}},{"chapterId":"psa-118","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"I was pushed so hard","kjv":"Thou hast thrust"}},{"chapterId":"psa-140","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"to make me stumble","kjv":"to overthrow"}},{"chapterId":"pro-14","v":32,"renderings":{"bsb":"is thrown down","kjv":"is driven away"}},{"chapterId":"jer-23","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"will be driven away into","kjv":"they shall be driven on"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Psalm 35:5","note":"Let them be as chaff before the wind, Yahweh’s angel driving them on.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Proverbs 14:32","note":"The wicked is brought down in his calamity, but in death, the righteous has a refuge.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Jeremiah 23:12","note":"Therefore their way will be to them as slippery places in the darkness. They will be driven on, and fall therein; for I will bring evil on them, even the year…","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H1761","lemma":"דַּחֲוָה","transliteration":"dachavah","gloss":"diversion"}],"senses":[{"id":"H1760B","gloss":"to thrust","relation":"H1760B = a form of"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}